WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Ryu guards standing heavy kick.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.300
Forward medium kick hits overhead after the guarded strike.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.300
Forward heavy kick follows the automatic portal launch.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Medium Stribog continues the juggle.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.300
Standing heavy punch catches Ryu.

6
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.400
Heavy Departure replaces the portal above the knockdown.
